\newlabel{tab:graph-subgraph}{{1}{5}{\textbf {Pipeline output: compression with high coverage.} \emph {Repl.}\ = fraction of end-to-end influence routed via features; \emph {Comp.}\ = fraction of incoming edge influence explained. Concept-aligned subgraphs preserve Completeness ($0.83$ vs.\ $0.90$) while compressing $\sim $600$+$ raw features into 30--50 supernodes (Repl.\ drops $0.70\!\to \!0.54$). Descriptive only.\relax }{table.caption.2}{}}
